@hostAddress = http://localhost:5161

### Health check
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Model info
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/v1/model/info
Accept: application/json

###

### Detect image (replace path with a real local image)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/v1/detection/detect
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="sample.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###
